WEBVTT

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:05.510
<i>The universe was created 
by a single explosion,</i>

00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:07.780
<i>which gave birth to an 
innumerable number of stars.</i>

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:11.220
<i>Just like we're attracted 
to the finality of life,</i>

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:12.850
<i>humans look up to the stars.</i>

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:15.960
<i>The constellations weave 
countless tales...</i>

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:19.660
<i>For example, one encounter 
may be the trigger,</i>

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:22.000
<i>and cause a "big bang" for a club.</i>

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:24.880
<i>The battle of the 
goddesses that hold the</i>

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:27.260
<i>cosmo close to their 
heart has just begun.</i>

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:30.660
<i>The seven Stars that convene 
in one clubroom...</i>

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:33.780
<i>Seven warriors. Seven "senshi's."</i>

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.440
<i>People call them...</i>

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:38.780
<i>the Astronomy Club.</i>

00:00:48.170 --> 00:00:51.000
Ebiten!

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:40.320
He starts his new single life.

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:43.700
Ryoko is furious and drag 
everybody into a fight

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:46.300
for she wakes up too late from hangover

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:48.510
and unable to send her sweetheart off.

00:02:48.510 --> 00:02:51.230
In Tokyo, he and his 
grandfather attacked

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:55.080
by three monsters created by Yugi

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:58.430
when they tried to drive the 
evil spirits out of a land.

00:02:58.430 --> 00:03:02.900
He also meet a beautiful young 
high school girl, Sakuya.

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:04.400
Looks like...

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:09.350
Yeah, my class...

00:03:09.350 --> 00:03:10.850
It's boring.

00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:13.310
Why would you want to pay attention?

00:03:13.310 --> 00:03:13.880
Huh?

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:14.880
No... That's not...

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:19.540
My boyfriend's always saying 
he can't believe that I'm a teacher.

00:03:19.540 --> 00:03:22.450
I mean, Todayama, you're 
totally into research,

00:03:22.450 --> 00:03:24.970
and I'm always looking for true love,

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:27.080
so I bet my class must 
be a joke for you!

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:27.080
Sorry... I'll read the book.

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:30.060
Looks like the separated family—

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:32.460
Anyway, class is over.

00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:35.970
Don't worry about saying 
goodbye. Laters.

00:03:56.470 --> 00:03:58.040
Oh, wait, Todayama!

00:03:58.040 --> 00:03:59.950
I'll go with you to the clubroom—

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:02.820
The Forbidden Sanctuary

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:04.550
Ouch...

00:04:05.270 --> 00:04:08.490
No! Don't look!

00:04:08.490 --> 00:04:11.210
I'm so embarrassed.

00:04:11.210 --> 00:04:15.170
No... N-No...

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:14.110
Kanamori.

00:04:15.170 --> 00:04:16.710
No sounding like a perv.

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:18.860
But I said no...

00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:22.100
<i>Someone once said that 
we're very blessed.</i>

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:20.970
Hey, w-wait up!

00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:24.190
<i>That we were born, by chance</i>

00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:24.350
Hey, did you hear?

00:04:24.190 --> 00:04:26.320
<i>into an era with these 
wonderful people,</i>

00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:26.350
Oomori-sensei was saying that there was

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:28.730
<i>and were able to grow up with them.</i>

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:28.730
a transfer student 
interested in our club.

00:04:28.730 --> 00:04:33.230
<i>That all of this was like a miracle.</i>

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:34.790
<b>Come back to life!</b>

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:34.790
<b>The Legend of the Struggling Astronomy Club</b>

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:41.410
<i>But that's not what I think.</i>

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:44.540
<i>People meeting new people has meaning,</i>

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:47.160
<i>just like the stars rotating in the sky.</i>

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:58.440
<i>We're born into an era 
where there are as</i>

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:00.470
<i>many people as the number of stars,</i>

00:05:00.470 --> 00:05:02.300
<i>meet each other by chance,</i>

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:04.560
<i>and spend time together 
in the same club.</i>

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:12.230
<i>I'm sure all of it happens in 
accordance with the stars' guidance.</i>

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:20.340
<b>Struggling 
Astronomy Club</b>

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:29.340
<b>Student Council</b>

00:05:28.270 --> 00:05:29.330
Come in.

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:32.760
Student Council President 
Iseda, you called?

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:34.330
Hasumi...

00:05:35.380 --> 00:05:36.310
We're shutting it down.

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:36.880
Huh?

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:39.350
We're shutting down the 
Astronomy Club today.

00:05:39.350 --> 00:05:41.430
But... Why?

00:05:41.430 --> 00:05:42.520
I just now made the decision.

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:45.260
You're acting quite 
overbearing, as usual.

00:05:45.260 --> 00:05:47.980
Just do what I say!

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:51.850
Would you tell me the reason?

00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:53.010
The first problem is that

00:05:53.010 --> 00:05:55.050
the Astronomy Club has too few members.

00:05:55.050 --> 00:05:57.610
And it doesn't seem like they're 
doing any real activities.

00:05:57.950 --> 00:06:00.260
I could give you a mountain of reasons.

00:06:01.610 --> 00:06:02.990
I see.

00:06:03.350 --> 00:06:06.800
However, I don't think you can 
shut it down so easily.

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:09.750
The Astronomy Club is a 
place special to me

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:11.220
that I created with one of my best friends.

00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:15.790
So we just have to get more 
members, for starters, correct?

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:17.500
Understood.

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:18.430
I...

00:06:20.200 --> 00:06:23.260
Pegasus should be quite 
beautiful tonight.

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:37.020
N-No!

00:06:35.590 --> 00:06:36.190
Huh?

00:06:39.280 --> 00:06:40.530
That smells good.

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:43.720
What incense do we have 
today, Todayama-san?

00:06:42.550 --> 00:06:44.410
I've had enough!

00:06:44.410 --> 00:06:45.820
Don't cry, Kanamori.

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:47.580
Today isn't the first time

00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:49.330
you've been stripped down, you know.

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:53.480
Why does this have to happen to me?

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:55.540
It's fanservice. 
First impressions, you know?

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:56.810
We don't need that!

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:57.230
I see.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:59.270
Dumbass! A first impression 
is important!

00:06:57.230 --> 00:06:59.190
What are they doing?

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:00.840
What we always do.

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:01.670
Fine, I'm just going to cut 
your underwear into pieces!

00:07:00.840 --> 00:07:01.570
Huh?

00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:03.090
Haven't you noticed, Vice President?

00:07:01.670 --> 00:07:03.090
Stop!

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:04.770
This first-year student...

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:08.100
I'm not going to forgive you for this!

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:07.110
Her uniform doesn't fit her at all.

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:08.100
Well, that's true.

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:10.130
You want to join the club?

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:12.660
Yes... U-Um, I...

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:15.920
Write your name and year on this paper

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:17.980
and submit it to your teacher.

00:07:19.310 --> 00:07:20.900
That'll get you into the club.

00:07:20.900 --> 00:07:22.370
But just a little while ago, she...

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:23.610
I'm not letting you do that!

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:25.430
Todayama-san?

00:07:25.430 --> 00:07:28.190
I'm not letting someone 
enter this club with

00:07:28.190 --> 00:07:29.830
a little scrap of paper like that.

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:33.180
We need a test to see 
if she's right for the club.

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:35.120
That's Kanamori's bag.

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:36.420
Huh? What?

00:07:36.420 --> 00:07:37.290
This is it!

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:40.880
Th-That's the doujinshi I bought!

00:07:40.880 --> 00:07:42.010
Give it back!

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:44.970
Come on... Get away from me, Kanamori.

00:07:43.960 --> 00:07:46.450
Just give it back already!

00:07:44.970 --> 00:07:47.210
This is why I hate needy girls.

00:07:47.210 --> 00:07:50.600
Hiromatsu, could you restrain this 
girl while we're conducting the test?

00:07:51.010 --> 00:07:52.050
Sure, I guess.

00:07:52.050 --> 00:07:54.640
Oh, and confiscate the gym clothes 
she's wearing right now, too.

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:55.770
Roger that.

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:55.770
Wait, what?

00:07:55.770 --> 00:07:58.900
Anyway, I'm going to make some tea.

00:07:56.460 --> 00:07:58.900
No, not that!

00:08:00.230 --> 00:08:01.280
Here you are.

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:03.800
That smells good.

00:08:03.800 --> 00:08:04.800
That reminds me...

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:07.110
When I came into the clubroom, 
something smelled really good.

00:08:07.110 --> 00:08:11.410
Yes, Todayama-san always has 
incense burning for us.

00:08:11.740 --> 00:08:13.250
She likes it.

00:08:13.790 --> 00:08:16.790
All right, now that Kanamori's quiet,

00:08:17.170 --> 00:08:19.080
how about we start the test?

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:21.790
Forbidden Sanctuary

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:20.140
You need imagination if you

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:21.800
want to be a part of the Astronomy Club.

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:24.760
Imagination...?

00:08:24.760 --> 00:08:25.700
That's correct.

00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:32.580
Hiromatsu, isn't he sticking 
that in a weird spot?

00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:36.130
No, that's right.

00:08:36.130 --> 00:08:38.340
But isn't that too far to the back?

00:08:38.340 --> 00:08:40.980
No, they're both guys, so that's 
the way it's supposed to work.

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:42.110
Don't look at it! Don't look at it!

00:08:41.070 --> 00:08:42.110
I see.

00:08:42.110 --> 00:08:44.130
That's Kanamori for you.

00:08:44.130 --> 00:08:45.060
This is one crazy book you've—

00:08:45.060 --> 00:08:46.950
You're the one being crazy!

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:50.380
Why do I have to be tied up, anyway?!

00:08:48.950 --> 00:08:50.380
U-Uh...

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:51.660
Oh, yeah.

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:51.700
Hurry up and untie me!

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:53.490
We were supposed to be testing her.

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:53.490
Don't ignore me!

00:08:54.610 --> 00:08:56.280
Why do you have scissors?!

00:09:02.840 --> 00:09:04.010
What's wrong with you?

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:06.440
You have another here, 
so what's the problem?

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:08.100
Two of the same book, too.

00:09:08.100 --> 00:09:09.940
One of those was for my collection...

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:12.850
You cut up the one I 
was planning to read.

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:18.310
Kanamori, I wouldn't just do something

00:09:18.310 --> 00:09:20.710
for the sole purpose of making you sad.

00:09:20.710 --> 00:09:21.770
You know that, right?

00:09:21.770 --> 00:09:24.450
But you do... all the time.

00:09:22.900 --> 00:09:25.820
It'll be fine. Don't worry.

00:09:24.450 --> 00:09:26.530
That's all you ever do, actually.

00:09:26.530 --> 00:09:28.120
That, or making me angry,

00:09:28.120 --> 00:09:30.410
or making me do bad things—

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:32.570
And this is where you come in,

00:09:32.570 --> 00:09:33.710
my dear first-year student!

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:34.330
Huh?

00:09:34.730 --> 00:09:36.820
What's this?

00:09:36.820 --> 00:09:40.360
Put the manga back together 
using those pieces.

00:09:40.360 --> 00:09:41.080
Huh?

00:09:41.300 --> 00:09:43.930
It will be your mission 
to put that back together

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:43.930
<i>This is the entry test?</i>

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:46.340
for your lamenting Kanamori-senpai.

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:46.340
<i>What's the point of this?</i>

00:09:46.340 --> 00:09:50.840
<i>No, I'm sure she has some 
reason to make me do this.</i>

00:09:52.420 --> 00:09:54.560
<i>Wait, I heard that astronomy once</i>

00:09:54.560 --> 00:09:56.150
<i>was the art of trying to solve the</i>

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:58.800
<i>relationship of balance and 
harmony between the gods...</i>

00:09:59.770 --> 00:10:03.020
<i>I bet she wants me to find 
the harmony in these</i>

00:10:03.020 --> 00:10:05.770
<i>pieces of paper, just like the 
harmony between the stars.</i>

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:09.000
<i>Back to its natural harmonious self!</i>

00:10:19.320 --> 00:10:20.300
I'm done.

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:22.050
I see.

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:23.990
Let's see.

00:10:24.490 --> 00:10:25.460
Huh? What's this?

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:28.470
Was it in so many pieces before?

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:31.420
Apparently the original was like that.

00:10:31.420 --> 00:10:33.030
Really?

00:10:33.030 --> 00:10:35.100
I happen to have the first 
volume of the original here.

00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:37.110
He's Japanese, but he's in Greece?

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:38.110
Correct.

00:10:38.110 --> 00:10:39.960
Isn't this subtitle kind of weird?

00:10:39.960 --> 00:10:41.280
It says microcosm, but...

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:42.490
It's fine.

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:43.980
Uh...

00:10:43.980 --> 00:10:46.450
Oh, yeah. I forgot about her again.

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:48.120
Let's see...

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:50.220
There are pieces leftover. 
No good at all.

00:10:50.220 --> 00:10:51.370
You fail.

00:10:51.900 --> 00:10:52.730
Wait.

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:56.170
This is easier to read 
than it was originally.

00:10:58.040 --> 00:10:59.080
Well, that's true.

00:10:59.080 --> 00:11:01.190
Pegasus, get on all fours.

00:11:01.190 --> 00:11:03.110
My cosmo is about to explode.

00:11:03.110 --> 00:11:04.270
I can feel it now.

00:11:04.270 --> 00:11:05.680
This is easier.

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:07.320
Don't read that!

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:09.000
Take a look at this, Kanamori.

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:10.420
It's a lot easier to read now.

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:11.920
Then untie this rope!

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:14.030
Then she passes, right?

00:11:14.030 --> 00:11:17.010
No, the book was too weird 
in the first place.

00:11:14.990 --> 00:11:17.010
Don't just ignore me!

00:11:17.010 --> 00:11:18.960
We're giving you a second test!

00:11:18.960 --> 00:11:20.310
We're still doing this?

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:28.070
Right!

00:11:28.070 --> 00:11:31.820
First, clean up the mess you've made.

00:11:31.820 --> 00:11:33.320
Oh, no problem.

00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:36.050
All done.

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:36.920
Huh?

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:38.700
I've made some tea.

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:41.090
Garbage can

00:11:51.510 --> 00:11:53.160
It's a pain preparing all of this stuff,

00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:55.150
so why not just pass her already?

00:11:55.150 --> 00:11:59.180
No! Don't try to finish everything 
up so quickly, lazy.

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:58.140
Would you like some more tea?

00:11:58.140 --> 00:11:59.340
Oh. Sure.

00:11:59.340 --> 00:12:03.050
What are they doing, anyway?

00:12:03.050 --> 00:12:05.580
They said they needed to 
get some things ready.

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:06.240
I see.

00:12:06.790 --> 00:12:08.210
All right, first-year.

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:11.220
Your second test for entry 
into this club is...

00:12:11.590 --> 00:12:12.370
This!

00:12:20.310 --> 00:12:22.970
V-Vice President?

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:26.330
No, I am the avatar of Athena.

00:12:42.690 --> 00:12:43.820
Pretty, isn't it?

00:12:44.270 --> 00:12:47.120
We can be an Astronomy Club, 
too, when we feel like it.

00:12:49.680 --> 00:12:51.970
If you want to join the Astronomy Club,

00:12:51.970 --> 00:12:54.160
you must defeat all its gold members,

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:57.130
which protect the twelve signs 
of the zodiac, in battle.

00:12:58.140 --> 00:13:01.630
If you win with distinction, 
we will allow your entry.

00:13:03.090 --> 00:13:05.230
Will you accept? Or won't you?

00:13:05.230 --> 00:13:05.930
Huh?

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:08.770
If you wish to challenge us, 
you need that box—

00:13:10.770 --> 00:13:12.900
The Pope's arrow has suddenly 
penetrated my chest!

00:13:12.900 --> 00:13:13.400
What?!

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:17.520
If you don't stand victorious 
soon, I shall die!

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:18.620
Or so says the script.

00:13:24.890 --> 00:13:26.280
The script says I'll die.

00:13:26.280 --> 00:13:27.640
Okay, I'll do it!

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:29.350
All right! Here comes 
the twelve signs of the

00:13:29.350 --> 00:13:31.460
zodiac version of the 
Astronomy Club test!

00:13:32.020 --> 00:13:38.810
<b>Round One</b>

00:13:32.770 --> 00:13:34.090
First sign of the zodiac.

00:13:34.090 --> 00:13:36.190
Your opponent: a fujoshi into cosplay,

00:13:36.190 --> 00:13:38.840
in parentheses: the perv of the group, 
Kanamori Hakata!

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:41.870
If you want to make it past me,

00:13:41.870 --> 00:13:44.140
Virgo, you'll have to defeat me!

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:46.920
Uh...

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:48.480
Hey, Kanamori!

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:49.590
If you keep your eyes closed,

00:13:49.590 --> 00:13:50.900
she'll be able to do 
whatever she wants to you!

00:13:50.900 --> 00:13:54.520
The second I open my eyes 
is the second you die.

00:13:57.570 --> 00:13:58.720
Hey, first-year!

00:13:58.720 --> 00:14:01.650
I'll help you, so show 
this girl what's what.

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:03.950
Todayama... Whose side are you on?

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:05.530
Now knock it off!

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:06.810
Don't take that off!

00:14:06.810 --> 00:14:08.490
My gold cloth!

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:10.040
No!

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:14.660
This should be everything.

00:14:13.510 --> 00:14:18.240
That's not part of my cosplay, 
those are my panties!

00:14:15.560 --> 00:14:16.770
Oh, she's down.

00:14:16.770 --> 00:14:18.170
One... Two...

00:14:22.760 --> 00:14:25.800
You're pretty good if you're 
able to take down Kanamori.

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:32.560
I didn't do anything...

00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:41.540
<b>Round Two</b>

00:14:34.990 --> 00:14:36.450
The second sign of the zodiac:

00:14:36.450 --> 00:14:38.880
the samurai axolotl with the ice smile,

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:40.600
Tarot Card Hiromatsu!

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:41.570
Huh?

00:14:48.330 --> 00:14:50.270
What's up with that outfit?

00:14:50.270 --> 00:14:51.120
I don't know.

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:52.570
To explain—

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:54.540
Kanamori, we don't need you anymore!

00:14:55.520 --> 00:14:57.810
That was a popular battle suit that—

00:14:57.810 --> 00:14:58.970
Don't be stupid!

00:14:58.970 --> 00:15:00.440
This is boring.

00:15:00.440 --> 00:15:01.380
Senpai?

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:05.110
It seems you're fated 
to join this club.

00:15:05.110 --> 00:15:07.360
But the vice president is next.

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:08.540
Be careful.

00:15:11.350 --> 00:15:13.980
What?! When did she lose?!

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:21.670
<b>Round Three</b>

00:15:14.690 --> 00:15:17.830
The next sign of the zodiac is 
the star-watching girl of fire,

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:19.480
Vice President Ooba.

00:15:20.830 --> 00:15:23.260
Well, that's normal.

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:25.200
It's just the Astronomy Club, you know?

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:26.340
Let me explain!

00:15:26.340 --> 00:15:28.670
A five item set for an ultimate 
star-watching experience.

00:15:28.670 --> 00:15:31.670
A down jacket, down pants, a 
thermal hat, thermal gloves.

00:15:31.670 --> 00:15:33.200
If she only had a 'scope right now,

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:35.350
she'd be the hottest astronomy 
girl you've ever seen!

00:15:35.350 --> 00:15:38.790
This is the epitome of a gold 
cloth for astronomy members!

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:42.210
Perfectly coordinated fashion for 
star-watching during winter!

00:15:44.010 --> 00:15:45.090
Why...

00:15:46.740 --> 00:15:49.210
I welcome you to our club.

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:57.660
There are words here.

00:15:56.910 --> 00:16:01.330
Young men who visit here, 
I entrust Athena to you.

00:15:57.660 --> 00:16:00.590
There are words carved into 
the wall where it shattered.

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:02.360
Sorry.

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:05.230
Wh-Why...

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:08.570
Tears, one after another, 
fill my eyes and fall.

00:16:08.930 --> 00:16:10.860
What is this burning emotion I feel,

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:12.990
welling up from deep within me?

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:15.840
I hereby once again swear to you.

00:16:15.840 --> 00:16:19.250
We will protect Athena's life.

00:16:19.250 --> 00:16:21.500
You got the vice president, too...

00:16:21.800 --> 00:16:23.510
In this case... I'll have to...

00:16:25.150 --> 00:16:28.650
The final battle, Kyouko Todayama!

00:16:29.490 --> 00:16:33.620
Sorry, but I cannot permit 
your entry into this club.

00:16:33.620 --> 00:16:35.680
I'll be the one to win here.

00:16:46.970 --> 00:16:47.690
Huh?

00:16:49.130 --> 00:16:53.330
That's... not a weapon....

00:16:53.550 --> 00:16:54.330
That's right!

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:56.580
This is something I've 
created: the Dob II!

00:16:56.580 --> 00:16:57.850
Dob?

00:16:57.850 --> 00:17:00.710
You mean a Dobsonian 
Reflecting Telescope?

00:17:01.150 --> 00:17:02.710
You mean the telescope 
that you can make

00:17:02.710 --> 00:17:04.270
yourself, that the American amateur

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:06.120
astronomer, Dobsonian, proposed?

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:07.370
The one nicknamed Dob?

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:08.690
Probably looks something like this.

00:17:07.370 --> 00:17:08.720
Hi there. I'm Dob.

00:17:09.040 --> 00:17:11.440
But in order to make something 
as high quality as that,

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:14.010
you'd need to know quite a bit...

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:15.220
Who could have made that...

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:17.100
I already told you I did...

00:17:17.100 --> 00:17:18.790
But I've made improvements to it

00:17:18.790 --> 00:17:21.460
so I can use it in another fashion...

00:17:27.920 --> 00:17:32.530
Konpeito Meteor Fist!

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:33.880
Ow! Ow!

00:17:34.470 --> 00:17:36.860
Huh? I'm not Pegasus?

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:40.990
If you find yourself in 
danger, open that box!

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:41.580
Huh?

00:17:42.270 --> 00:17:46.630
Whether you find an evil spirit 
or hope within it depends on you.

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:05.110
Huh?

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:08.940
Kaiser Knuckle!

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:09.910
That's what was in it?

00:18:09.910 --> 00:18:12.450
We've got ourselves a real 
looking weapon all of a sudden!

00:18:14.280 --> 00:18:18.330
I've got you now!

00:18:38.410 --> 00:18:40.300
She's completely knocked out.

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:42.610
Actually, she's asleep.

00:18:42.610 --> 00:18:44.530
Anyway, a win is a win.

00:18:44.530 --> 00:18:46.770
She's not joining our club.

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:48.070
Todayama-san.

00:18:49.240 --> 00:18:51.310
Why do you want to stop new people

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:54.550
from joining so badly, Todayama-san?

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:03.200
Because it's fun.

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:04.330
What?

00:19:07.110 --> 00:19:09.900
After deliberation, we've decided

00:19:09.900 --> 00:19:11.760
that Todayama's win will be nullified.

00:19:11.760 --> 00:19:13.530
What?!

00:19:15.650 --> 00:19:17.920
Victories should be fair,

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:20.870
so I've thought of a different method.

00:19:20.870 --> 00:19:22.150
What would that be?

00:19:22.150 --> 00:19:23.180
Rock, paper, scissors.

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:23.900
Huh?

00:19:23.900 --> 00:19:26.730
It's true the wonderful 
Akimoto-sensei said that

00:19:26.730 --> 00:19:29.030
rock, paper, scissors provides fairness.

00:19:29.030 --> 00:19:31.790
If you win at rock, paper, scissors 
I'll let you in the club.

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:33.640
How's that?

00:19:34.110 --> 00:19:35.230
I see.

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:41.370
Fine.

00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:45.020
If you're going to insist, 
then I have no choice.

00:19:45.020 --> 00:19:46.540
Okay, here we go then.

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:50.040
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:52.990
Congratulations, you won!

00:19:52.990 --> 00:19:55.170
So you're in the club now.

00:19:55.170 --> 00:19:55.550
Huh?

00:19:55.550 --> 00:19:57.270
Here's your club entry form.

00:19:59.170 --> 00:20:00.920
<b>Club Entry Form
 Club Year
 Class Noya Itsuki</b>

00:20:01.240 --> 00:20:03.570
What was all of that for?

00:20:03.570 --> 00:20:06.190
It's because we're the Astronomy Club.

00:20:06.190 --> 00:20:06.890
Sigh.

00:20:12.360 --> 00:20:14.060
Oh, it's Oomori-sensei.

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:15.000
Huh?

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:17.700
She's the advisor for 
the Astronomy Club.

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:17.700
Kitty!

00:20:18.180 --> 00:20:21.660
Oomori-sensei, we've 
got a new member today.

00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:22.770
She's a first-year.

00:20:22.770 --> 00:20:25.480
Oh, hi there. I'm...

00:20:25.480 --> 00:20:26.260
No.

00:20:26.260 --> 00:20:26.910
Huh?

00:20:30.400 --> 00:20:32.830
This is the advisor.

00:20:35.840 --> 00:20:38.870
Uh... Oomori-sensei?

00:20:38.870 --> 00:20:40.560
I'm not a teacher!

00:20:40.560 --> 00:20:42.680
I'm Oomori Shouko!

00:20:42.680 --> 00:20:44.510
This is the teacher.

00:20:44.850 --> 00:20:47.180
I will fade away!

00:20:52.990 --> 00:20:54.810
What was that?

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:56.530
She had a falling out 
with a guy again, I bet.

00:21:09.850 --> 00:21:12.630
That's the Great Square of Pegasus, 
it comes out in the fall.

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:15.000
It's beautiful.

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:18.140
Anyway, you're an official member

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:20.010
of the Astronomy Club now.

00:21:20.010 --> 00:21:22.410
Th-Thank you, everyone.

00:21:24.550 --> 00:21:26.010
Thanks to you,

00:21:26.010 --> 00:21:28.770
it looks like the Astronomy 
Club won't be shutting down.

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:31.020
Thank you very much.

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:35.090
Uh, but... To be honest 
this is my first club...

00:21:35.090 --> 00:21:36.510
It's fine.

00:21:36.510 --> 00:21:37.400
Huh?

00:21:38.160 --> 00:21:42.590
The stars shine equally for everyone.

00:21:46.910 --> 00:21:49.570
Look at how red the moon is.

00:21:49.570 --> 00:21:51.050
Almost like something 
bad's gonna happen.

00:21:51.050 --> 00:21:51.540
What?

00:21:51.540 --> 00:21:54.780
We just got her. Don't make fun of her.

00:21:54.780 --> 00:21:55.680
Right?

00:21:55.680 --> 00:21:58.960
Oh yeah, what's your name, anyway?

00:21:58.960 --> 00:22:03.390
Oh... Noya... Noya Itsuki.

00:22:03.390 --> 00:22:04.870
Nice to meet you, Noya-san.

00:22:04.870 --> 00:22:07.900
Finally, someone who's a 
junior to me. I'm so happy.

00:22:07.900 --> 00:22:09.760
Let's have a welcome party.

00:22:13.690 --> 00:22:16.640
<i>Noya Itsuki, huh?</i>

00:22:21.120 --> 00:22:22.320
<i>That's right...</i>

00:22:22.320 --> 00:22:25.490
<i>Everything happens in 
accordance with the stars' guidance.</i>

00:22:35.710 --> 00:22:37.750
Itsuki-sama...

00:22:38.260 --> 00:22:42.170
<i>And so our club that was 
struggling every day</i>

00:22:42.170 --> 00:22:44.180
<i>got a new member.</i>

00:22:45.290 --> 00:22:48.380
<i>That was the event of the fall.</i>

00:24:21.450 --> 00:24:23.810
Can you feel the breath 
of the Astronomy Club?

00:24:24.420 --> 00:24:27.270
Move. Strip its clothes. 
Repel it with a spring!

00:24:27.270 --> 00:24:29.430
Gather and fight in the arena!

00:24:29.920 --> 00:24:31.360
For the chosen,

00:24:30.920 --> 00:24:34.610
All Cosplay Figure Cosplay

00:24:31.360 --> 00:24:34.640
we have a cosplay series 
of figures for Ebiten!

00:24:34.640 --> 00:24:38.480
You can win the Pope version 
of Kyouko in this contest!

00:24:36.680 --> 00:24:38.560
Pope Kyouko / Comes with throne
 This contest is now over

00:24:38.620 --> 00:25:00.000
Next time
<b>Crybaby Hakata's Transformation of Splendor</b>
